  "notes": "B.A. Elementary Education, Licensure Pathway (all concentrations), School of Education. SEMESTER SYSTEM — all credits are semester hours. Built from the official MSU Denver Elementary Education Major, B.A., All Concentrations – Licensure Pathway 4-year plan, 2023-2024 Catalog (https://www.msudenver.edu/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/2023-24-Elementary-Major-Lic-1.pdf). Includes School of Education admission process; Praxis exams at recommended points (Social Studies, Science, Reading, Math). Concentration courses (12cr) vary by chosen concentration and are modeled as student-choice slots. Field experiences (45 hrs each) in EDU 3445, RDG 3335, EDU 3665; Residency I (7cr) and Residency II (9cr) in final year. All courses require C or better. Official plan totals 123cr (degree minimum 120).",
